fix: make playwright import optional so web API boots without it

The news-scraping design agent's `playwright` dependency was moved out of
requirements.txt to slim the production image, but main.py still imported it
at module top level, crashing the container on boot (ModuleNotFoundError).
Guard the import and its single call site so the web API runs without
playwright; the scraping agent no-ops cleanly when it's absent.

